00:28:43.602 --> 00:28:44.685
So remember those numbers.

00:28:44.685 --> 00:28:47.150
It'll there's a test later.

00:28:47.150 --> 00:28:48.775
And so these are all
the dataflow jobs,

00:28:48.775 --> 00:28:50.400
and there's two ways
you can view this.

00:28:50.400 --> 00:28:51.860
One, here all our dataflow jobs.

00:28:51.860 --> 00:28:53.450
Two, here all the
machines that are

00:28:53.450 --> 00:28:55.190
