00:29:21.320 --> 00:29:24.470
Imagine this were a unified
framework with an automation

00:29:24.470 --> 00:29:27.080
and orchestration harness
where these queries could

00:29:27.080 --> 00:29:30.080
be run automatically
via the BigQuery API.

00:29:30.080 --> 00:29:33.380
These transformations could be
applied and rerun many times

00:29:33.380 --> 00:29:35.948
a day in parallel
and in sequence.

00:29:35.948 --> 00:29:38.240
Automation could be kicked
off both in this environment

00:29:38.240 --> 00:29:40.500
and within other
stakeholders environments.

00:29:40.500 --> 00:29:42.500
So this is a
